    "detail": {
      "id": 1000957,
      "name": "[Affinity] Solid Companionship",
      "desc": "Zhu Yuan has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>[Quick Reload]</color>.\nQuick Reload: When Zhu Yuan activates <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attacks</color>/<color=#FFFFFF>Ultimates</color>, gain the <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Reload</color> effect. When Zhu Yuan has the <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Reload</color> effect and uses up all <color=#FFFFFF>Enhanced Shotshells</color>, the <color=#FFFFFF>Quick Reload</color> effect will be consumed to instantly gain 6/9 <color=#FFFFFF>Enhanced Shotshells</color>.",
      "desc2": "When Zhu Yuan confronts dangers and perils, she is never alone — Somewhere beyond her sight, numerous fellow officers stride alongside her. This camaraderie is the source of her confidence and pride as a Public Security officer.",
